| ≡    1 merged   ◆  2 #open   ▽  3 #deploy   ♦  4 #infra    +                   |
|┌keys · ↑↓ scroll · any other key closes───────────────────────────────────────┐|
|│F1                 keys                                                       │|
|│Enter              send                                                       │|
|│Tab                complete                                                   │|
|│PgUp PgDn          scroll                                                     │|
|│S-Enter M-Enter    new line                                                   │|
|│← → Home End       move the cursor                                            │|
|│Bksp Del           edit                                                       │|
|│click a message    selects it; in the compose box it places the cursor; a chip│|
|│Alt+1-9            tab (again: menu)                                          │|
|│F2                 tabs                                                       │|
|│Ctrl+T             the tab bar, as F2: ← → move, Enter its menu, Esc back     │|
|│right-click a tab  its menu; so does a click on the tab shown                 │|
|│M-m                mouse on or off (off lets the terminal select text)        │|
|│Shift-drag         selects text while the mouse is on, in most terminals      │|
|│middle-click       pastes only while the mouse is off                         │|
|│Esc ^C             quit; asks over a draft; else Esc asks and y quits         │|
|│click              a tab shows it; the wheel scrolls                          │|
|│                                                                              │|
|│help: chat                                                                    │|
|│Enter sends to the shown channel; merged sends to #open. @name or #channel    │|
|│at the start addresses the message; Tab completes them, and on an empty       │|
|└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘|
